      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just... so heavy lately. the shadows in this house, the way the wind sounds in the halls... it never stops. i feel like i'm just drifting through a ghost story, elias. i'm so tired of fighting it. i just want it to be quiet. i want to sleep and never have to wake up to this gray world again.",
